Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-22): merged into one skill: a checklist made for the deliverable (examples for pages, mass emails, quotes, launches), two independent reviewers as Sklubot helpers with a three-round cap, a five-point self-score with evidence, proof that a sent message is in Sent, and a repair procedure; code, deployment and script parts removed; approvals kept; translated into French.
Only text is included; no script, picture or other file of the original folders is bundled. Names of other products are not used as titles.
